<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84885" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ-θῠρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with many doors</i> or <i>windows,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.99e
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>with many holes,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριβώνιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>with many plates</i> or <i>leaves,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέλτου . . πολύθυροι διαπτυχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					727
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
